The comment "@@@ After the addition of an element, the Count of the list should increase by one, and it should return the new Count." corresponds to the `Add` method in the code. 

Here is the code:

```cs
public virtual int Add(Object value)
{
    if (_size == _items.Length) EnsureCapacity(_size + 1);
    _items[_size] = value;
    _version++;

    return _size++;
}
```
